=== A4 testbed (session 6): seeds 1-500, 500 agents; NR6 profile (D1; d22: theta on PTF density, PTH housing only, discounts skip the tax share; d23: wages indexed to P_G); labor at central values (rho 0.16, eps 0.33, delta 0); d40: N7_BLEI on (BLEI raise attributed to the design where its support carries the adult over the gate); lines deflated (D2); lamG 1 ===
